ed milestones and current status.\\n- INDEX.md: document map and ownership/source-of-truth index.\\n- PRD.md: product/project requirements, users, acceptance criteria, non-goals.\\n- TDD.md: test/technical design document covering architecture assumptions, test strategy, verification commands, and risk cases.\\n\\nRules:\\n- Read /Volumes/code/workspace/AGENTS.md and project-local AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md/README/package manifest before writing.\\n- Preserve human-authored content, especially anything after <!-- MANUAL -->. If a required file exists, improve it incrementally instead of replacing it wholesale.\\n- Do not edit files outside /Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex.\\n- Prefer accurate, short, professional docs over template filler.\\n- Every P0/P1 TODO item must include a requirement ID and at least one test case.\\n- Final answer must include an Evidence section listing changed files and verification output.\\n- This is a third-party/reference checkout: write local-overlay/reference governance docs only. Do not claim Axi owns upstream product direction. Preserve upstream README content and make new docs clearly local operational overlays.\\n\\nRun the required verification command after writing:\\ntest -f \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/README.md\\" && test -f \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/README.zh-CN.md\\" && test -f \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/AGENTS.md\\" && test -f \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/CHANGELOG.md\\" && test -f \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/TODO.md\\" && test -f \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/MILESTONES.md\\" && test -f \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/INDEX.md\\" && test -f \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/PRD.md\\" && test -f \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/TDD.md\\" && rg -n \\"PRD|TDD|Milestone|TODO|opencodex\\" \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/README.md\\" \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/PRD.md\\" \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/TDD.md\\" \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/MILESTONES.md\\" \\"/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/INDEX.md\\"", "status": "failed", "history": [{"at": "2026-06-08T01:26:19.029Z", "id": "legacy-2026-06-08T01:26:19.029Z-created-0", "data": {}, "actor": "system", "event": "created", "message": "Task created"}, {"at": "2026-06-08T01:31:10.930Z", "id": "legacy-2026-06-08T01:31:10.930Z-completed-1", "data": {"runId": "local-fallback-1780882270930-739da9eb-4ace-40cd-9845-cb5dc62df367", "success": true, "exitCode": 0, "verification": {"output": " CC Switch or `MINIMAX_API_KEY`; DeepSeek uses `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`. The proxy must be running while Codex Desktop is configured with the managed `opencodex` provider.\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/README.md:76:`Codex Plus.app` uses its own config home at `~/.codex-plus/codex-app-home` and keeps `OPENCODEX_THIRD_PARTY_ONLY=1`, so its model catalog is limited to third-party models such as MiniMax and DeepSeek. It shares the native Codex session store by symlinking the session database and session directories from `~/.codex` instead of copying and rewriting them on every restart. This preserves previous sessions and avoids changing native Codex threads to `opencodex` providers.\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/README.md:109:For a persistent Codex Desktop setup on macOS, run the proxy in HTTP-only mode through launchd. The installed service used by this repo is `dev.opencodex.aggregate`; unload it with `launchctl bootout gui/$(id -u) ~/Library/LaunchAgents/dev.opencodex.aggregate.plist`.\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/README.md:156:git clone https://github.com/AITabby/opencodex.git\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/README.md:157:cd opencodex\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/README.md:178:这只会增加 `[model_providers.opencodex]`，不会写顶层 `model_provider` 或 `model_catalog_json`。Codex App 仍保持原生 provider，因此 GPT 模型和历史线程继续按官方路径工作。如果明确需要单个聚合下拉菜单，再用 `OPENCODEX_SELECT_PROVIDER=1 scripts/enable-aggregate-codex-app.sh`；这个模式会让 Codex Desktop 使用 `opencodex` provider，可能影响已有 App 会话。\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/README.md:180:聚合 preset 可以暴露四类模型：原生 GPT（`gpt-*`，复用 Codex App 的 ChatGPT OAuth）、代理 GPT（`gpt-*-proxy`，走本机 CC Switch relay `127.0.0.1:15721`）、MiniMax（`MiniMax-*`）和 DeepSeek（`deepseek-*`）。MiniMax key 从 CC Switch 或 `MINIMAX_API_KEY` 读取，DeepSeek 使用 `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`。Codex Desktop 配置为 managed `opencodex` provider 时，OpenCodex proxy 必须保持运行。\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/README.md:184:`Codex Plus.app` 使用独立配置目录 `~/.codex-plus/codex-app-home`，并固定 `OPENCODEX_THIRD_PARTY_ONLY=1`，因此模型列表只包含 MiniMax、DeepSeek 等第三方模型。它通过符号链接共享原生 `~/.codex` 下的会话数据库和会话目录，不再在每次重启时复制会话并把 provider 改写成 `opencodex`。这样既保留历史会话，也不会把原生 Codex 线程改成第三方 provider。\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/README.md:217:macOS 上可以用 launchd 常驻 HTTP-only proxy。本机安装的服务名是 `dev.opencodex.aggregate`；回退时用 `launchctl bootout gui/$(id -u) ~/Library/LaunchAgents/dev.opencodex.aggregate.plist` 卸载。\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/TDD.md:1:# OpenCodex 🚀 TDD\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/TDD.md:5:- Root path: `/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex`\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/TDD.md:7:- Top-level entries: `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `README.md`, `README.zh-CN.md`, `TEST_FLOW.md`, `dist-macos/`, `package-lock.json`, `package.json`, `preview.png`, `scripts/`, `src/`, `test_opencodex.mjs`, `test_translator.mjs`, `tsconfig.json`\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/TDD.md:15:2. `PRD.md` defines requirements and non-goals.\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/TDD.md:16:3. `TDD.md` defines verification strategy.\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/TDD.md:17:4. `TODO.md` maps requirements to tasks and tests.\\n/Volumes/code/workspace/references/opencodex/TDD.md:30:for f in 