ommits | `.gitignore` covers `*.db`, `downloads/`, `logs/`, `certs/`, `__pycache__/`; `TODO.md` `REQ-VIDL-P1-002` |\n| Python 3.13 / mitmproxy drift | README recommends Python 3.12; `__init__.py` re-exports stay tested by `REQ-VIDL-P1-001` |\n| Local tool grows into a network service | `AGENTS.md` "Cross-Project Boundary" + `PRD.md` §4 Out of Scope |\n\n## Change Log\n\n- 2026-06-08: initial `MILESTONES.md` created alongside the deep-init docs suite pass.\nEOF\necho "CHANGELOG + TODO + MILESTONES written"' in /Volumes/code/workspace\n succeeded in 0ms:\nCHANGELOG + TODO + MILESTONES written\n\nhook: PostToolUse\nhook: PostToolUse\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\nhook: PostToolUse Completed	2026-06-08 09:14:31.271+08	2026-06-08 09:24:35.94+08
